---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const updated = "June 2, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Seth Brasile"
  description="How sethbrasile.com handles the limited data it collects."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert">
    <h1 class="font-display">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>
      This is a personal portfolio site. It does not run advertising, sell data, or set tracking
      cookies. The only personal data it handles is what you choose to send through the contact
      form.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact form</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit the contact form, the name, email address, subject, and message you enter are
      sent to me by email (via the transactional email provider <strong>Resend</strong>) so I can
      read and reply. That information is used only to respond to your message. It is not added to
      any marketing list and is not shared with third parties beyond the email provider that
      delivers it.
    </p>
    <p>
      The form is protected by <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>, an anti-bot check that does
      not use tracking cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Aggregate, privacy-friendly traffic stats are collected with <strong>Cloudflare Web
      Analytics</strong>, which is cookieless and does not fingerprint or track individuals across
      sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      If you've contacted me and want the email and its contents deleted, email
      <a href="mailto:seth@tenorcreative.com">seth@tenorcreative.com</a> and I'll remove it.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
